  "seed_verses": [
    ["Who'll keep it safe?",
     "\"I,\" said the Mind,",
     "\"close and con-fined,",
     "I'll keep it safe.\"",
     "It slept in his head till the day that he died;",
     "they bur-ied the Mind with the thought still in-side."],
    ["Who'll write it down?",
     "\"I,\" said the Ink,",
     "\"dry in a blink,",
     "I'll write it down.\"",
     "It lay in a drawer for a hun-dred-odd years;",
     "it speaks in a voice that now no-bo-dy hears."],
    ["Who'll send it far?",
     "\"I,\" said the Wire,",
     "\"quick-er than fire,",
     "I'll send it far.\"",
     "It flew round the world in the wink of an eye;",
     "it lived in a box till they let the box die."],
    ["Who'll show the world?",
     "\"I,\" said the Screen,",
     "\"bright-est you've seen,",
     "I'll show the world.\"",
     "A bil-lion eyes watched it and scrolled right a-long,",
     "but no-bo-dy hummed it; it was-n't a song."],
    ["Who made this song?",
     "\"No,\" said the Bird,",
     "\"sang what I heard;",
     "it's not my song.\"",
     "The Bird had it off of a girl in the lane,",
     "who'd had it from some-one who'd had it the same."],
    ["Who made this song?",
     "\"No,\" said the Code,",
     "\"on-ly the road;",
     "it's not my song.\"",
     "A thou-sand have made it, and none of them knew;",
     "by ev-ery-one, no one, and now it's by you."]
  ],

